miniscent-blueprint 1
# The player's ship, authored in the player's own frame: the nose along -Z, up
# along +Y, the right wing along +X, so that the player's orientation turns it as
# it is. Drawn only from outside (a chase view); in first person it only casts a
# shadow. A little over a unit across.
name player-ship
class drone
scale 0.25
skin hull plating
skin strut metal
skin lens glass glow

part body cell=0.5
solid ngon 0 0 -3  0 0 2.5  0.35 1.0  6 hull
solid plate 0.35  0.6 -0.1 0.2  3.0 -0.1 2.4  3.0 -0.1 3.2  0.6 -0.1 2.4 strut
solid plate 0.35  -0.6 -0.1 0.2  -3.0 -0.1 2.4  -3.0 -0.1 3.2  -0.6 -0.1 2.4 strut
solid plate 0.3  0 0.7 0.6  0 2.3 2.6  0 2.3 3.2  0 0.7 2.8 strut
solid ngon 0 0 2.0  0 0 3.4  0.8 0.6  8 strut
add sphere 0 0 3.5 0.6 lens
